    "description": "Along a private beach on the Atlantic Ocean, this posh resort on tropical grounds is 10 km from Lynden Pindling International Airport.\nPolished rooms and suites offer flat-screens, Wi-Fi and minibars, plus Keurig coffeemakers, ocean views and tablets. Some have balconies, kitchens, free-standing tubs and/or sitting areas.\nThere are 17 restaurants, 3 cafes and 9 bars, as well as an ice cream stand, a cigar lounge and event space. Other amenities include an art gallery, a spa and 6 outdoor pools, along with an 18-hole golf course, tennis courts, a gym and a swanky casino. Breakfast, water sports and valet parking are available."
